// Game inherits Mortar::MortarGame which inherits from some base.
// Game::Update delegates entirely to GameTaskUpdate(dt).
// GameTaskUpdate uses a task state machine: *Game = current task byte → indexes function table.
//
// HitBomb (0x0016b0fc): on bomb slice in non-Zen mode:
//   1. Game+0x10 = countdown timer (set to game-over delay constant)
//   2. FruitCamera::CreateCameraShake(cam, {a=DAT, b=2.0, c=?}, ...)
//   3. GameTask state struct: +0xcc/0xd0/0xd4 = bomb_pos, +0xf8 = 0
//   4. GameSound::SFXPlay(bomb_hit_sfx)
// In Zen mode bomb hit: AddToCurrentScore(-10, 0, false, false); WaveManager::ResetSpeed; PowerUpManager::ClearTimedPowers
