// ============================================================
// FruitSlicedPacket  (network sync packet)
// ============================================================
// Constructed with: waveNumber, entityTrackerID, rotation (ushort), magnitude (float), points (int)
// Sent via NetworkManager on each online multiplayer fruit slice.
// Also used for Bomb slices (FruitSlicedPacket variant).
//
// ============================================================
// Scoring pipeline summary
// ============================================================
// 1. SlashEntity::Update → iterates Fruit/Bomb entities via ActorManager
// 2. For each: SlashEntity::CollideWithEntity (line–circle segment test)
// 3. On hit: entity->vtable->CollisionResponse(entity, slash, 0, 0, &bladeVel)
// 4. Fruit::CollisionResponse:
//    a. Check critical probability (Game.m_ScoreThreshold / WaveManager::GetCriticalChance)
//    b. Play SFX, spawn juice particles, AddSlice() visual
//    c. Compute points: base = FRUIT_INFO.m_BaseScore; critical += bonus
//    d. AddToCurrentScore(points, playerIdx, true, false)
//    e. WaveManager::AddSpeed in Zen mode
//    f. FruitSaveData tracking (per-fruit stats, achievements)
//    g. AchievementManager checks
// 5. AddToCurrentScore:
//    a. Apply GetScoreMultiplyer * delegate modifier
//    b. Add to Game.m_CurrentScore (+0x18)
//    c. Decrement Game.m_ScoreThreshold (+0x30) on tier crossing → play SFX
//    d. FruitSaveData::AddToTotal for stat tracking
// 6. SlashEntity combo scoring (triggered on timer expiry):
//    a. Decrement Game.m_ScoreThreshold
//    b. AddToCurrentScore(comboCount, entityType, true, ...)
//    c. BonusManager::AddCombo in Zen mode
//    d. Coin::MakeCoins for coin rewards
//
